<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PIA Merchandising lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PIA Merchandising lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has lowered its rating on PIA Merchandising Services Inc to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage firm said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately released.  Analyst Andrew Shore was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Irvine, Calif.-based provider of merchandising services at retail stores closed at 8-5/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
